      "content": "honey isn't going to stop this hacking though lol. look, i'm just trying to be practical. i've seen people take these two things fine. what's the actual specific risk? is it like, a super rare thing or is it actually dangerous? if it's just a minor thing i'd rather just take the syrup and deal with it than sit here coughing all night.",
